Grok Mermaid renderer provenance
=================================

The pure-Rust Mermaid renderer in third_party/ is vendored from
xai-org/grok-build revision 8a14c91d.

Grok Build is licensed under Apache-2.0. The embedded mermaid-to-svg crate is
MIT licensed and derives its layout from Rust ports of Dagre/Graphlib. Exact
upstream provenance, local hardening notes, and third-party attributions are
preserved in each vendored Cargo.toml, LICENSE, and THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES file.

Vendored directories:
- third_party/mermaid-to-svg
- third_party/dagre_rust
- third_party/graphlib_rust
- third_party/ordered_hashmap
